  "releaseNotes": "Version 16.2.0.66579:\n\n• Added a new WPF demo project for the .NET 8 build. \n• Added CADImport.CADImportForms.New.LayerForm for the .NET 8 build, featuring enhanced layer editing capabilities. The legacy   CADImport.CADImportForms.LayerForm remains functional but has been marked as obsolete and will be removed in the next release. \n• Updated demo projects targeting .NET Framework that use CADEditorControl. \n• Updated the default field values used when creating new CADImage instances.\n• Kernel improvements: updates to CADDimensionStyle and HeadVarStruct.",
